@startuml
title Detailed Sequence Diagram: UC-05 Subcontractor Tracking
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Manager" as Mgr
participant "WebDashboard\n<<React>>" as Web
participant "SubcontractorController\n<<Node.js API>>" as API
database "MySQL\n<<Database>>" as DB

Mgr -> Web: Enter Subcontractor Details & Quotation Amount
activate Web
Mgr -> Web: Assign Subcontractor to Specific Task (BOQ Item)

Web -> API: POST /api/subcontractors (subcontractorData)
activate API

API -> DB: INSERT INTO Subcontractors (Name, Contact, QuotationAmount)
activate DB
DB --> API: return subID
deactivate DB

API -> DB: UPDATE Tasks SET SubcontractorID={subID} WHERE TaskID={taskID}
activate DB
DB --> API: return success
deactivate DB

API --> Web: HTTP 201 Created
deactivate API

Web --> Mgr: Display "Subcontractor Assigned Successfully"
deactivate Web

@enduml